Z||000000||GT Bastard||10-31-1999||10:05 PM||||What's everyone runnin' for gears in their rear-end? I'm running 3.33's in my auto and I'm guessing that's the performance axle, but does anyone know for sure?||||reg||1
Z||000001||88formula||11-01-1999||05:09 PM||||The 5speed isuzu manual transmission has a 3.35-1 (4cyl) final drive ratio, the 5speed getdrag has a 3.61-1 (6cyl), and the three speed automatic has a 3.18-1 final drive ratio (6&4cyl). There is no listing for a performance ratio, got this from my 88 owners manual.  <p>[This message has been edited by 88formula (edited 11-01-1999).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||88 Fiero||11-01-1999||05:13 PM||||4-Speeds on the 4 cylinder '84 Fiero's got 4.10 gears on it...||||reg||1
Z||000003||Tim||11-01-1999||06:30 PM||||'84 4-speeds also had 3.32 <BR>both had .73 fourth gear and 3.53 first gear<BR>||||reg||1
